							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							You have to copy and paste, or try this:<br /><br /><a href="http://www.newsday.com/news/nationworld/nation/wire/sns-ap-honor-roll-privacy,0,4328248.story?coll=sns-ap-nation-headlines" target="_blank">Nashville Honor Roll</a><br /><br />Unfortunately, this has been a trend for as long as I can remember. &nbsp;There has been talk of eliminating grades all together since I left school because we might &quot;hurt poor Johny&#039;s feelings.&quot; &nbsp;Anyone wonder why we have such wimps these days in government and business?<br /><br />
