							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							And I thought California was backwards on a lot of things.<br />I was never an honor roll student. &nbsp;I just didn&#039;t apply myself. &nbsp;Hell most of the people on the honor roll were the ones getting picked on not vica versa.<br />Kids need competition. &nbsp;They crave it. &nbsp;Instead of denying them it when should instead teach them how to deal with it. &nbsp;How to take the bad with the good.<br />Ok where&#039;s my gun, I&#039;m going lawyer hunting...
