	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg6031"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=314" title="View the profile of Qenam">Qenam</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/sephirot.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								*blinks*<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=314"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:R_Ann79@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=602.msg6031#msg6031"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=602.msg6031#msg6031">Re:You've got to be kidding me...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> March 08, 2004, 08:52:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Maybe it has something to do with the fact parents are paranoid about the school system as it is. IMO most people don&#039;t get an education anyhow, teachers are too scarce and students are 25-40 per one teacher. And over half of those are geting left behind because a teacher doesn&#039;t have the time to teach one on one as most students need to be. Most students are ashamed to have to ask for help due to ridicule of their classmates. So they just fail and say oh well I don&#039;t care. But it is that type of person that ends up serveing you bigmacs at MacDonalds. <br /><br />Maybe one day Schools will go back to the basics where students go to school to learn. Til then, I plan on homeschooling my kids. At least their grade won&#039;t be part of their attendance. And I don&#039;t have to worry about them cheating off the smart kid. I want my kids to get the hell out of my house as soon as possible so I don&#039;t have them liveing in my basement playing EQ at 45 O_o<br /><br /><br />Moraganna 64 Cleric<br />Qenam 65 Enchanter
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
